# Plugin source code is deliberately NEVER part of this repo (see
# wiki/Plugin-Development.md) - installed plugins live entirely outside
# the deployed panel tree at /opt/server-panel-plugins on a real server,
# so there is nothing to ignore there by construction. This entry only
# covers a LOCAL convention for developing/testing a plugin against this
# checkout before pushing it to its own separate repo.
/plugins/
panel-src/plugins/
